{"seq":1,"slug":"monitoring-drift","title":"监控与漂移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-model-deployment/operations/monitoring-drift","wordCount":1753,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"监控与漂移\">监控与漂移</h1><p>软件出故障会抛异常、会 500、会有红色告警，你立刻知道出事了。模型出故障却往往悄无声息——它照样返回一个看似合理的预测，只是越来越多地预测错，而所有服务指标（QPS、延迟、错误率）一片绿。这种「绿着烂掉」的特性，使监控成为机器学习运维里最不能省、又最容易被忽视的一关。这一篇讲清要监控什么、漂移有几种、以及在真实标签姗姗来迟时怎么办。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>模型监控是对生产中的模型进行持续观测，以及时发现性能退化及其成因。它分两层：一层是运营监控（延迟、吞吐、错误率），与任何服务无异；另一层是机器学习特有的质量监控——输入数据漂移、预测分布漂移、以及真实性能下降。后者关注的核心现象是漂移：模型赖以生效的统计假设随时间被现实打破。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[生产推理流量] --&gt; B[运营监控&lt;br/&gt;延迟·QPS·错误率]&#10;    A --&gt; C[输入特征监控&lt;br/&gt;分布 vs 训练基线]&#10;    A --&gt; D[预测分布监控]&#10;    A -.延迟到达.-&gt; E[真实标签]&#10;    C --&gt; F{数据漂移?}&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; G{性能下降/概念漂移?}&#10;    F --&gt;|PSI/KS 超阈值| H[告警]&#10;    G --&gt;|指标跌破阈值| H&#10;    H --&gt; I[触发自动重训练]\">flowchart TD\n    A[生产推理流量] --&gt; B[运营监控&lt;br/&gt;延迟·QPS·错误率]\n    A --&gt; C[输入特征监控&lt;br/&gt;分布 vs 训练基线]\n    A --&gt; D[预测分布监控]\n    A -.延迟到达.-&gt; E[真实标签]\n    C --&gt; F{数据漂移?}\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; G{性能下降/概念漂移?}\n    F --&gt;|PSI/KS 超阈值| H[告警]\n    G --&gt;|指标跌破阈值| H\n    H --&gt; I[触发自动重训练]</pre><p>下表区分两类漂移——这是监控里最该分清的概念，因为它们的检测手段与应对策略不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>是否需真实标签</th>\n<th>典型成因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据漂移 data drift</td>\n<td>输入特征分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(X)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 变化</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>用户群体变化、季节性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>概念漂移 concept drift</td>\n<td>特征与标签关系 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(Y|X)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 变化</td>\n<td>是（或代理）</td>\n<td>业务规则变、外部环境变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标签漂移 label drift</td>\n<td>目标分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(Y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 变化</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>正负样本比例变化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"数据漂移-vs-概念漂移\">数据漂移 vs 概念漂移</h2><p>把两类漂移分清是监控的第一课。数据漂移是输入分布变了——比如疫情让用户行为整体迁移，但「什么样的用户会违约」这个规律没变。概念漂移更阴险：输入分布可能没怎么动，但特征与标签之间的关系变了，比如一项新政策让原本低风险的人群变得高风险，模型学到的旧规律直接失效（<a href=\"https://futureagi.com/blog/model-vs-data-drift-how-to-identify-and-handle-it/\">数据漂移与模型漂移 2026</a>）。</p>\n<p>二者的关键差异在于「能否无标签检测」。数据漂移只看输入分布，不需要真实标签就能发现；概念漂移涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(Y|X)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，原则上需要真实标签才能确认。这个差异直接决定了监控架构——而真实标签往往迟到甚至缺席，这正是下面要处理的难题，也呼应了 <a href=\"../foundations/ml-lifecycle\">机器学习生命周期</a> 里提到的标签延迟问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"怎么量化漂移-psi-与-ks-检验\">怎么量化漂移：PSI 与 KS 检验</h2><p>检测数据漂移靠统计手段比较「当前分布」与「参考分布（通常是训练集）」。两个最常用的工具是 PSI 和 KS 检验。</p>\n<p>群体稳定性指数（PSI）把参考与生产数据分箱，对每个箱计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>PSI</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PSI} = \\sum_i (a_i - e_i)\\ln\\frac{a_i}{e_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PSI</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1951em;vertical-align:-0.4451em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7115em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4101em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4451em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该箱在生产与参考中的占比。经验阈值是：PSI 小于 0.1 无显著偏移，0.1 到 0.2 中等，大于 0.2 显著漂移。对连续特征，Kolmogorov-Smirnov（KS）检验比较两个累积分布，用两样本 KS 统计量配合按批量大小校准过的 p 值阈值来判定——校准这一步很重要，否则海量样本下任何微小差异都会显著，造成告警疲劳（<a href=\"https://labelyourdata.com/articles/machine-learning/data-drift\">漂移检测技术 2026</a>）。</p>\n<p>值得注意的是，这套「当前分布 vs 参考分布」的比较，与 <a href=\"../pipeline/ci-cd-ml\">机器学习 CI/CD</a> 里训练前的数据校验本质同源，只是时机不同：CI 是入口把关，监控是上线后的持续观测。统一用 <a href=\"../serving/feature-stores\">特征存储</a> 的特征定义作为观测口，可以让两处共用同一份基线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"无标签监控与告警闭环\">无标签监控与告警闭环</h2><p>真实标签往往延迟数天甚至数月（贷款是否违约要等很久），这时不能干等着算准确率。2026 年成熟的做法是借助无需标签的监控工具：Evidently 的漂移预设可自动对所有特征跑 PSI 与 KS 并产出可视化报告；NannyML 专长于在没有真实标签时估计性能指标，并能用 PCA 重构误差捕捉单变量方法漏掉的特征相关性变化（<a href=\"https://towardsdatascience.com/drift-detection-in-robust-machine-learning-systems/\">漂移检测工具</a>）。这让团队在标签回流之前就能预警性能下滑。</p>\n<p>监控的终点不是仪表盘，而是行动。一个成熟的监控系统把告警接成闭环触发源：PSI 超阈值或估计性能跌破红线时，自动触发重训练流程（见 <a href=\"../operations/retraining-automation\">自动重训练</a>），而非依赖人工偶然瞥见图表。这条「监控告警 → 自动重训」的通路，正是 <a href=\"../foundations/mlops-maturity\">MLOps 成熟度</a> 高级别的标志，也是 <a href=\"../foundations/ml-lifecycle\">机器学习生命周期</a> 那条反馈边真正自动化的体现。同时要警惕告警疲劳——阈值和窗口要校准，否则团队会学会忽略告警，监控就形同虚设。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反模式与务实建议\">反模式与务实建议</h2><p>监控的反模式，核心是「看到了却没用，或干脆看错了」。</p>\n<p>一是<strong>只监控服务指标</strong>：盯着 QPS、延迟、错误率，它们全绿时模型可能已经在悄悄错，这正是「绿着烂掉」。二是<strong>拿准确率当唯一指标</strong>：在标签延迟的场景下等真实标签回流，等到时模型已坏了数周。三是<strong>阈值不校准</strong>：直接用默认的漂移阈值，海量样本下任何微小差异都被判显著，告警刷屏后团队学会忽略。四是<strong>告警不接行动</strong>：告警只推到面板或群聊，靠人偶然瞥见才处理，监控没有闭环到重训练。务实做法是：运营层与质量层都监控、标签未到时用无标签方法、阈值按批量校准、并把告警直接接成重训练触发源。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>只监控服务指标</td>\n<td>只看 QPS/延迟/错误率</td>\n<td>绿着烂掉、退化无人察觉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>只等准确率</td>\n<td>依赖延迟的真实标签</td>\n<td>等标签回来时已坏数周</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阈值不校准</td>\n<td>用默认漂移阈值</td>\n<td>告警刷屏后被忽略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>告警不接行动</td>\n<td>只推面板/群聊</td>\n<td>监控不闭环到重训练</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>模型故障是「绿着烂掉」——服务指标全绿但预测越来越错，因此监控是机器学习运维最不能省的一关。</li>\n<li>监控分运营层（延迟/QPS/错误率）与机器学习质量层（数据漂移、预测漂移、真实性能），后者关注漂移。</li>\n<li>数据漂移是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(X)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 变（可无标签检测），概念漂移是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(Y|X)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 变（需真实标签或代理），二者应对策略不同。</li>\n<li>量化漂移用 PSI（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_i (a_i-e_i)\\ln\\frac{a_i}{e_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1951em;vertical-align:-0.4451em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7115em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4101em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4451em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，&gt;0.2 显著）和 KS 检验，p 值阈值须按批量校准以防告警疲劳。</li>\n<li>标签延迟时用 Evidently/NannyML 做无标签监控，并把告警接成自动重训练的闭环触发源——这是高成熟度与生命周期反馈边的体现。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"监控与漂移","id":"监控与漂移"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"数据漂移 vs 概念漂移","id":"数据漂移-vs-概念漂移"},{"level":2,"text":"怎么量化漂移：PSI 与 KS 检验","id":"怎么量化漂移-psi-与-ks-检验"},{"level":2,"text":"无标签监控与告警闭环","id":"无标签监控与告警闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式与务实建议","id":"反模式与务实建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"推理扩展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-model-deployment/serving/scaling-inference"},"next":{"title":"自动重训练","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-model-deployment/operations/retraining-automation"}}